<script>let { method = null, feedback = "", onmethod = () => {}, onpractice = () => {}, ondrill = () => {} } = $props();</script>
<div class="tabs" id="methodTabs">{#each method?.tabs ?? [] as tab}<button class="tab" class:active={tab.active} data-method={tab.id} onclick={() => onmethod(tab.id)}>{tab.icon} {tab.short}</button>{/each}</div>
<div id="methodContent">{#if method}{#key method.id}<div class="method-title"><span>{method.icon}</span><div><h3>{method.name}</h3><p>{method.tagline}</p></div></div><p>{method.rule}</p><div class="method-cue"><b>什么时候想到它？</b><p>{method.cue}</p></div><h4>跟着一个例子找线索</h4><div class="equation">{method.equation}</div><p>{method.thinking}</p><details class="worked"><summary>拆开看，每一步怎么算</summary>{#each method.steps as step, i}<p>{i+1}. {step}</p>{/each}</details><div class="transfer"><h4>换一组牌，试着迁移</h4><p class="mini-cards">{#each method.drill.nums as n}<span>{n}</span>{/each}</p><p>{method.drill.question}</p><div class="drill-choices">{#each method.options as option}<button class="secondary" data-drill-choice={option.choice} onclick={() => ondrill(option.choice)}>{option.label}</button>{/each}</div><p id="drillFeedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">{feedback ?? ""}</p><details class="worked"><summary>看看迁移思路</summary><p>{method.drill.why}</p><p><b>{method.drillEquation}</b></p></details></div><p class="lesson-trap">容易踩的坑：{method.trap}</p><div class="method-metrics"><span>看过相关解析 <b>{method.counts.seen}</b> 题</span><span>未看解析答对 <b>{method.counts.applied}</b> 题</span></div><p class="fineprint">统计按不同题目计数，不因重复查看而增加；“未看解析”可以包含使用提示，不代表已经熟练掌握。手册示例不计入 500 题进度。</p><button class="primary" style="margin-top:15px" data-practice={method.id} onclick={() => onpractice(method.id)}>回到游戏，练一道同类题 →</button>{/key}{/if}</div>
